# "Target creature card exiled with The Darkness Crystal" (CR 115.1, 607.2b): a card is a creature card by its
# characteristics in exile. On turn 3 Bot1 Shocks Bot2's Memnite, and on turn 4 Bot2's Mutavault, animated into a 2/2
# creature until end of turn; the Crystal exiles both for 2 life each. In exile Mutavault is a land card, not a creature
# card, so on turn 7 the Crystal's ability refuses it, and returns the Memnite as a 3/3.
# The Darkness Crystal {2}{B}{B}: Legendary Artifact
